{"availability":"available","full":"southleft/ds-contracts-poc","name":"ds-contracts-poc","description":"Component contracts: one machine-readable source of truth that generates both a React library and a Figma library, proves they match with a three-way differ, extracts contracts back out of existing code or designs, and runs the whole loop in a browser playground. Candidate spec for design-system contracts.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":73,"forks":1,"created":"2026-07-03T17:18:31Z","updated":"2026-10-15T14:29:16Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ds-contracts-playground.pages.dev","topics":["ai-governance","code-generation","codegen","component-library","contracts","design-systems","design-to-code","design-tokens","dtcg","figma","react","specification"],"demo":"https://ds-contracts-playground.pages.dev/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:13.803Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:13.803Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:13.803Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T18:00:58.409Z","stars":70,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-13T04:14:51.929Z","stars":71,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-15T15:01:13.803Z","stars":73,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["New here? Try a Figma component set in React. The technical preview quickstart installs the supplied CLI archive, checks your set and shows how to install the result in your app.","Connect your component library in code and your design library in Figma through a shared, machine-readable contract.","Start with a React library or a Figma library. Read its supported structure, properties, tokens and composition into a contract, then generate the other surface. When both exist, compare changes against their shared baseline and repair differences under your team's ownership policy."],"features":["Explore contracts and deterministic generation. The local playground runs the checked-out engine. Supported contracts can produce code and native Figma writer programs.","Try React source import. The code-import view accepts static TSX/CSS experiments and reports supported facts and limitations. It is not yet a general repository import or a verified React-to-Figma journey.","Inspect original React sources. The local /sources workflow validates original styling and states, reads installed API facts, and delivers supported root or composed graphs to an authorized Figma file through the…","Evaluate existing import and generation paths. CLI and plugin workflows expose proposals and named limitations. They require setup and review; they do not yet deliver the full automatic journeys above."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/southleft/ds-contracts-poc/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"db21af408229e1d65be81b88f60e819b924ee52065310a73daf85644662ab930","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:13.942Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:13.942Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"New here? Try a Figma component set in React. The technical preview quickstart installs the supplied CLI archive, checks your set and shows how to install the result in your app.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/southleft/ds-contracts-poc/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"db21af408229e1d65be81b88f60e819b924ee52065310a73daf85644662ab930","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/southleft/ds-contracts-poc/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:13.943Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T14:29:16Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/southleft/ds-contracts-poc/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:13.943Z","hash":"db21af408229e1d65be81b88f60e819b924ee52065310a73daf85644662ab930","originalBytes":11026,"storedBytes":11026,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["react","docs","figma","contract","supported","component","npm","source","what","code","composition","local","existing","run","contracts","library","must","other",